        <div class="prose text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground dark:prose-invert mb-8">
          <div x-show="$store.global.lang === 'en'"><h3>Laravel Asset Management</h3><p>Built an internal web application using PHP Laravel and MySQL for tracking and managing company assets and inventory. Features include asset registration, categorization, status tracking, and reporting dashboard.</p></div>
          <div x-show="$store.global.lang === 'id'"><h3>Manajemen Aset Laravel</h3><p>Membangun aplikasi web internal menggunakan PHP Laravel dan MySQL untuk melacak dan mengelola aset serta inventaris perusahaan. Fitur meliputi registrasi aset, kategorisasi, pelacakan status, dan dashboard laporan.</p></div>
        </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8">
              <span class="text-sm font-medium border border-border h-8 w-fit px-3 rounded-lg flex items-center">PHP</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium border border-border h-8 w-fit px-3 rounded-lg flex items-center">Laravel</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium border border-border h-8 w-fit px-3 rounded-lg flex items-center">MySQL</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium border border-border h-8 w-fit px-3 rounded-lg flex items-center">Bootstrap</span>
          </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
